      "tr": "`d = (...) ** 2).sum(axis=2)`, sonra `d.argmin(axis=1).tolist()`.",
      "en": "`d = (...) ** 2).sum(axis=2)`, then `d.argmin(axis=1).tolist()`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef assign_labels(X, centers):\n    X, C = np.array(X, dtype=float), np.array(centers, dtype=float)\n    d = ((X[:, None, :] - C[None, :, :]) ** 2).sum(axis=2)\n    return d.argmin(axis=1).tolist()\n\nX = [[0, 0], [1, 1], [9, 9], [10, 8], [4, 4]]\ncenters = [[0, 0], [10, 10]]\nprint(assign_labels(X, centers))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef assign_labels(X, centers):\n    X, C = np.array(X, dtype=float), np.array(centers, dtype=float)\n    d = ((X[:, None, :] - C[None, :, :]) ** 2).sum(axis=2)\n    return d.argmin(axis=1).tolist()\n\nX = [[0, 0], [1, 1], [9, 9], [10, 8], [4, 4]]\ncenters = [[0, 0], [10, 10]]\nprint(assign_labels(X, centers))\n```"
